      "message": "[warning] Line 94: 🟡 `linkThumbnail`/`requestedLinkMetadata` are only reset when `target` changes, not when the same target’s `metadata` changes (or becomes `nil`). This can leave a stale thumbnail visible for a different/no link. Also, setting `requestedLinkMetadata` before `loadObject` and never clearing it on failure prevents retries for the same metadata object. Reset cached thumbnail state when metadata identity changes, and clear `requestedLinkMetadata` on load failure so later updates can retry.",
